stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: Checkout Initiated
    
    state "Pending (Redis Caching)" as Pending
    Pending --> Authorization_Failed: Stripe Webhook Error/Failure
    Pending --> Paid_Awaiting_Fulfillment: Stripe Webhook (intent.succeeded)
    Pending --> Expired: Session TTL (Redis) Timeout
    
    Paid_Awaiting_Fulfillment --> Processing: Seller Accepts Order
    Processing --> Shipped: Fulfilling & Handed to Courier
    
    Shipped --> Delivered: Confirmation from Logistics
    Shipped --> Delivery_Failed: Hub Error / Address Issues
    
    Delivered --> Return_Requested: User Claim (within 24hrs)
    Return_Requested --> Returned_Refunded: Seller Approved & Picked Up
    
    Delivered --> [*]: Order Success
    Authorization_Failed --> [*]
    Expired --> [*]
    Returned_Refunded --> [*]
    Delivery_Failed --> [*]
    
    %% Annotations for the Report
    note right of Pending: Temporary Redis state prevents price manipulation
    note left of Paid_Awaiting_Fulfillment: Synchronized via Kafka Service
